    "name": "The Farmer & the Chicken",
    "steam_appid": 2855280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid getting caught by the farmer! \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a strange object falls onto the farm, the chicken<strong>\ud83d\udc14</strong> eats it and is seemingly granted a mysterious power. The farmer has seen him and wants to catch him to take this object from him.\u00a0<strong>So the chicken embarks on a journey through different places to escape from the farmer</strong>\u00a0<strong>and reach the source of the strange object.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you must be careful in each place the farmer will have allies who will help him catch the chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the forest, a temple, the city, and more in this adventure. Prevent the chicken\ud83d\udc14 from being caught by the farmer</strong>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e<strong> and reach the source of the strange object.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855280/extras/7693a4d132ce890a64b1cf70363d86f1.avif?t=1746557984\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control the chicken<strong>\ud83d\udc14</strong>, you must move around the stage avoiding the farmers\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, you must hold out for <strong>3 minutes</strong> without being caught in order to advance to the next stage. However, some stages will also have <strong>other objectives</strong> that can be completed. There is a total of <strong>20 stages</strong>, with a variety of farmers with different abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember to collect the objects and get a new high score.</strong> \ud83e\udd47</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855280/extras/a870c2ccf1ce9787e2f4dbf44e7fad01.avif?t=1746557984\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the chicken has abilities\ud83d\udcaa that will help him in his adventure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg</strong>: Leaves an egg on the spot, which stuns the farmer who steps on it for a few seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong>: A boost that helps the chicken move and escape in certain situations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release the Chicken</strong>: Release the power of the strange object into the chicken to turn the tables and allow it to chase the farmer and stun him if it hits him.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid getting caught by the farmer! \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a strange object falls onto the farm, the chicken<strong>\ud83d\udc14</strong> eats it and is seemingly granted a mysterious power. The farmer has seen him and wants to catch him to take this object from him.\u00a0<strong>So the chicken embarks on a journey through different places to escape from the farmer</strong>\u00a0<strong>and reach the source of the strange object.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you must be careful in each place the farmer will have allies who will help him catch the chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the forest, a temple, the city, and more in this adventure. Prevent the chicken\ud83d\udc14 from being caught by the farmer</strong>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e<strong> and reach the source of the strange object.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855280/extras/7693a4d132ce890a64b1cf70363d86f1.avif?t=1746557984\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control the chicken<strong>\ud83d\udc14</strong>, you must move around the stage avoiding the farmers\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, you must hold out for <strong>3 minutes</strong> without being caught in order to advance to the next stage. However, some stages will also have <strong>other objectives</strong> that can be completed. There is a total of <strong>20 stages</strong>, with a variety of farmers with different abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember to collect the objects and get a new high score.</strong> \ud83e\udd47</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855280/extras/a870c2ccf1ce9787e2f4dbf44e7fad01.avif?t=1746557984\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the chicken has abilities\ud83d\udcaa that will help him in his adventure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg</strong>: Leaves an egg on the spot, which stuns the farmer who steps on it for a few seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong>: A boost that helps the chicken move and escape in certain situations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release the Chicken</strong>: Release the power of the strange object into the chicken to turn the tables and allow it to chase the farmer and stun him if it hits him.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
